# FitTrack — project rules

## Identity

FitTrack Routine Dashboard: premium mobile-first workout UI. Progress = **completed sets**, not reps.

## Constraints

- No `any` in TypeScript
- No backend/auth/DB unless user explicitly requests
- No real Excel parsing unless user explicitly requests
- No `localStorage` unless user explicitly requests
- Minimize scope; reuse `components/fitness/*` and `lib/mock-data` types
- Calm design: warm stone, sage accent — no neon gym colors

## Commands

`pnpm dev` | `pnpm build` | `pnpm lint`

## Before finishing

Run `pnpm build` on non-trivial changes.

## Docs

Read `AGENTS.md` and `docs/DOMAIN.md` for types and progress rules.
